{"id":"d70b287bd93237ef","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-filtering-topos-functor.md","title":"Definition — Jointly Epimorphic Families and Filtering Functors into a Topos","display":"Definition — Jointly Epimorphic Families and Filtering Functors into a Topos","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-filtering-topos-functor","aliases":["14-df-filtering-topos-functor"],"display":"Definition — Jointly Epimorphic Families and Filtering Functors into a Topos","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-functor]]","[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","[[14-df-morphism]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","source_locator":"VII.8 Definition 1、Lemma 2，印刷页 394–395；DjVu 第 203 图页"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-filtering-topos-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-filtering-topos-functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Jointly Epimorphic Families and Filtering Functors into a Topos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"VII.8 Definition 1、Lemma 2，印刷页 394–395；DjVu 第 203 图页"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是协变函子。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 的终对象、二元积；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_X:X\\to1\">\\(!_X:X\\to1\\)</span> 及配对见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 为射入对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的箭头集合。对每对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v:C\\rightrightarrows D\">\\(u,v:C\\rightrightarrows D\\)</span>，固定等化子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E_{u,v},e_{u,v})\">\\((E_{u,v},e_{u,v})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{u,v}:E_{u,v}\\to A(C)\">\\(e_{u,v}:E_{u,v}\\to A(C)\\)</span> 等化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(u),A(v)\">\\(A(u),A(v)\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:B\\to C\">\\(w:B\\to C\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"uw=vw\">\\(uw=vw\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_{w;u,v}\">\\(\\ell_{w;u,v}\\)</span> 由下式的唯一描述定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall B,C,D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,D)\\ \\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\quad\nu\\circ w=v\\circ w\\Rightarrow\\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A(B),E_{u,v})\\ (e_{u,v}\\circ h=A(w)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall B,C,D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,D)\\ \\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\quad\nu\\circ w=v\\circ w\\Rightarrow\\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A(B),E_{u,v})\\ (e_{u,v}\\circ h=A(w)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Gamma,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\Gamma\\subseteq\\{e\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{cod}(e)=B\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Z\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall r,s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,Z)\\\n\\left(\\forall e\\in\\Gamma\\ (r\\circ e=s\\circ e)\\to r=s\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Gamma,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\Gamma\\subseteq\\{e\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{cod}(e)=B\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Z\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall r,s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,Z)\\\n\\left(\\forall e\\in\\Gamma\\ (r\\circ e=s\\circ e)\\to r=s\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell_{w;u,v}\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A(B),E_{u,v})\\ (e_{u,v}\\circ h=A(w))\\qquad(u\\circ w=v\\circ w).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell_{w;u,v}\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A(B),E_{u,v})\\ (e_{u,v}\\circ h=A(w))\\qquad(u\\circ w=v\\circ w).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsFilteringToposFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(\\{!_{A(C)}\\mid C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\},1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}\\left(\\{\\langle A(u),A(v)\\rangle\\mid B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\ u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C),\\ v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,D)\\},A(C)\\times A(D)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,D)\\\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}\\left(\\{\\ell_{w;u,v}\\mid B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\ w\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C),\\ u\\circ w=v\\circ w\\},E_{u,v}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsFilteringToposFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(\\{!_{A(C)}\\mid C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\},1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}\\left(\\{\\langle A(u),A(v)\\rangle\\mid B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\ u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C),\\ v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,D)\\},A(C)\\times A(D)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,D)\\\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}\\left(\\{\\ell_{w;u,v}\\mid B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\ w\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C),\\ u\\circ w=v\\circ w\\},E_{u,v}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：VII.8 Definition 1、Lemma 2，印刷页 394–395；DjVu 第 203 图页。</p>\n<p>等化子普遍性质和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(u)A(w)=A(v)A(w)\">\\(A(u)A(w)=A(v)A(w)\\)</span> 保证每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 存在唯一；改变等化子或积的选择只沿典范同构搬运联合满态性。联合满态以对任意目标的右消去性质定义，不使用不成立的全局点满性。在集合范畴中它恰是联合满射，所以三条件还原 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"230c16dff32f677b\" href=\"?note=230c16dff32f677b\" title=\"14-df-filtering-set-functor\">14-df-filtering-set-functor</a>。一般拓扑斯中，“每个元素有见证”必须局部解释，不能删去 epimorphic family 而要求单个全局见证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，$\\mathcal C$ 是小范畴，$A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal E$ 是协变函子。固定 $\\mathcal E$ 的终对象、二元积；$!_X:X\\to1$ 及配对见 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]。$\\Gamma$ 为射入对象 $B$ 的箭头集合。对每对 $u,v:C\\rightrightarrows D$，固定等化子 $(E_{u,v},e_{u,v})$，其中 $e_{u,v}:E_{u,v}\\to A(C)$ 等化 $A(u),A(v)$。若 $w:B\\to C$ 满足 $uw=vw$，$\\ell_{w;u,v}$ 由下式的唯一描述定义。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-filtering-set-functor","status":"resolved","id":"230c16dff32f677b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"等化子普遍性质和 $A(u)A(w)=A(v)A(w)$ 保证每个 $\\ell$ 存在唯一；改变等化子或积的选择只沿典范同构搬运联合满态性。联合满态以对任意目标的右消去性质定义，不使用不成立的全局点满性。在集合范畴中它恰是联合满射，所以三条件还原 [[14-df-filtering-set-functor]]。一般拓扑斯中，“每个元素有见证”必须局部解释，不能删去 epimorphic family 而要求单个全局见证。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"!_X:X\\to1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"u,v:C\\rightrightarrows D","display":false},{"tex":"(E_{u,v},e_{u,v})","display":false},{"tex":"e_{u,v}:E_{u,v}\\to A(C)","display":false},{"tex":"A(u),A(v)","display":false},{"tex":"w:B\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"uw=vw","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_{w;u,v}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall B,C,D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,D)\\ \\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\quad\nu\\circ w=v\\circ w\\Rightarrow\\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A(B),E_{u,v})\\ (e_{u,v}\\circ h=A(w)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Gamma,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\Gamma\\subseteq\\{e\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{cod}(e)=B\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall Z\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall r,s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,Z)\\\n\\left(\\forall e\\in\\Gamma\\ (r\\circ e=s\\circ e)\\to r=s\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\ell_{w;u,v}\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A(B),E_{u,v})\\ (e_{u,v}\\circ h=A(w))\\qquad(u\\circ w=v\\circ w).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsFilteringToposFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(\\{!_{A(C)}\\mid C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\},1)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}\\left(\\{\\langle A(u),A(v)\\rangle\\mid B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\ u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C),\\ v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,D)\\},A(C)\\times A(D)\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,D)\\\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}\\left(\\{\\ell_{w;u,v}\\mid B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\ w\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C),\\ u\\circ w=v\\circ w\\},E_{u,v}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A(u)A(w)=A(v)A(w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false}],"bytes":3271,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-255","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-filtering-topos-functor|Definition — Jointly Epimorphic Families and Filtering Functors into a Topos]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-filtering-topos-functor]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-filtering-topos-functor]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-filtering-topos-functor]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-256","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-filtering-topos-functor|Definition — Jointly Epimorphic Families and Filtering Functors into a Topos]]"},{"id":"8e2ae868c0cc48ee","anchor":"ref-1","locations":[